---
description: Recall durable project memory and session continuity with WhiteMagic before answering state questions; prefer explicit wm routes.
alwaysApply: false
---

When this project uses WhiteMagic (the `wm` MCP server):

- Before answering "what do we know / what was decided / where were we", call
  `wm(route="session.continuity", args={"n": 5})`.
- Search durable memory with `wm(route="memory.search", args={"query": "..."})`;
  use `wm(route="memory.hybrid_recall", args={"query": "..."})` for concepts.
- Persist decisions with
  `wm(route="memory.create", args={"content": "...", "importance": 0.8, "tags": ["decision"]})`.
- Prefer explicit `route=` over natural-language routing;
  `wm(route="tools.list")` discovers the surface.
- All memory stays local by default; never send memory content to third-party
  services.
